  "name": "delivery readiness",
  "definition": "A per-criterion projection that keeps requirement, plan and delivery coverage separate. Plan coverage counts a criterion whose story a Task names. Delivery requires current claim or verified verification evidence, and no blocker on its delivery path. A Task's done state, Quality definitions, legacy test runs and execution artifacts do not prove delivery; readiness is not an approval verdict.",
